  "selection_reason": "Three previously unselected strictly READY P2 registrations cover three parents. An auxiliary-prime question over prime fields returns to the finite-field manuscript last used in wave 17, with a separate analytic entry. DISC-05 tests an explicit integer-lattice Weyl-symbol comparison permitted while the physical bridge is gated; its finite-grid count does not assert the native spectrum. Typed S3 loop labels have published provenance and the integer time calibration is an explicit hypothesis. No previously less-served extra parent supplied another presently executable substantive number-theory task. The earlier pure arithmetic hexagon note was unregistered and remains outside the cumulative task-ID counts.",
  "remaining_gates": "The low-service GEO6, F7, A3/A4 and Lean records have frozen, refuted, successor or formalization gates. The one remaining strict P1 requires controlled native Magma. H0O requires a Driver, the semiprime prior-art return is frozen, PCF is a closure audit, and the D24 lift lacks its native second-digit input. Registration status does not establish scientific admission for any of those cases.",
